{"id":"vod_lz_11180","vodId":"11180","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"排球少年 第二季","name_cn":"排球少年 第二季","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220426-1/c71f634f4b73980140c9e8d07ceff9aa.jpg"},"summary":"　　排球少年第二季剧情介绍：全集动画是排球少年的续集作品，排球少年第二季全集动画讲述的是小时候，日向翔阳从电视上看见排球比赛，乌野高中的一名小个子在球上的英姿，简直就是个“小巨人”，对此非常深刻，并开始迷上排球，一直想成为“小巨人”一样的人。初中时排球部不够人数，只好默默等待，后来在终于有新成员后，参与了第一次也是最后一赛的比赛，不幸对决了最强队伍，结果当然落败。单凭自己的话，是绝对无办法看见那景色的，不是自己一人的话，或许就能看见了…为了能够打出“胜利”的比赛，翔阳努力考入乌野高中，实现成为“小巨人”的排球梦想！                        ","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-12 14:28:01","classic":true,"classicRank":33,"franchise":"排球少年","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14464_cafd3129/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14465_1e8ee9cb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14466_bb658c8e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14467_b37ade7f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14468_6c5adf66/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14469_200ca58c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14470_8b1aeda1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14471_7a9d8121/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14472_9103fe36/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14473_12fa2f77/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14474_839441ae/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14475_612f0c58/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14476_f34e619d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14477_18174d7f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集